OL,3,GNEWSATwo held after boy, 16, stabbed at
OL,4,Aparty
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been arrested after
OL,7,Fa 16-year-old boy was seriously injured
OL,8,Fin a suspected stabbing at a Halloween
OL,9,Fparty in Cheshire.
OL,11,FCheshire Police said the boy was hurt
OL,12,Fat a house on Alder Lane, in Orford,
OL,13,FWarrington.
OL,15,FAn 18-year-old man and a 17-year-old
OL,16,Fboy were arrested on suspicion of
OL,17,Fsection 18 assault and have since been
OL,18,Freleased on bail, the force said.
OL,20,FOfficers were called to the property at
OL,21,Fabout 21:00 GMT on Saturday and the boy
OL,22,Fwas taken to hospital.
